Ted,
I concur with George, this is no small project.
The X4.2 sources took me 3.6 hours to compile when everything
was setup correctly. (PWS 500au) The log file (and you will need
to look through this) is over 54,000 lines.
The directory holding source AND .o files
will expand beyond 680 megs! I only compiled the code for the
cards I have and this does not include the fonts. Some of this may
go well but expect to spend a lot of time on the modules that
don't compile. 'make' won't use environment vars unless you ask it
to (make -e) and will stop at the first error unless you tell it
not to (make -k) Try something smaller first then when you understand
the issues and the process then come back to X,
Stephen Lewis

