Hello,
This is a long shot, but I have a bunch of PWS433's where I've had faulty
keyboards that prevent the computer from making it through POST.  I would get a
blank, blue screen with a cursor at the top left.  No other characters or text
would appear AT ALL.  I started replacing each component one at a time to try
to isolate the problem, starting with the RAM, then motherboard/cpu, then video
card, then harddrive.  Everything I swapped out did not help at all... until,
by chance, I changed the keyboard and the d@*%ed thing started right up with no
errors.

I've had this happen to 2 machines out of 300.  It's worth a try....Good
luck...
Terry

