No - none of the newer MILO's work on my XL366. The old 2.0.35 continues
in service for me.
RH7.0 wouldn't clean-install from the CD the way RH6.2 did.

Make the ramdisk floppy and boot with  boot -t is09660
scd0:kernels/vmlinux.gz root=/dev/fd0 load_ramdisk=1
That worked for me.

Luke




