Hello,

I was thinking about buying a printer to go with my Alpha machine,
and I was wanting to ask first if there are any particular issues
with printing from alphalinux (I'm running RH 7.1 on a 164LX).

I was thinking of buying the Brother HL-1450. I figured it was best
to look for a printer with Postscript, since I wasn't sure if
the other sorts of printer drivers are ported to alpha. Although it doesn't
explicitly support Linux, since it does do Postscript, I'm thinking I'll
be fine.

Have people had luck with getting other (non-Postscript) printers to
work?


Allen Z.




