With regards to your message at 08:58 AM 3/18/02, Damien J. Dye. Where you 
stated:
>Hi all.
>
>I have an LX164 alpha which has only 128mb of Ram
>
>I want to give it some more
>Does any body know of a manufacture which produces RAM for these units,
>Or will standard ECC ram work ?
You need SDRAM, PC100, ECC, Registered.
Kingston, Micron, Ventura, Corsair, Virtium all make parts that work, and I 
am sure some others too.
Do NOT buy PC133
The LX runs the memory on a 83MHz clock rate.
You need to install in matched pairs.


