On Mon, Mar 18, 2002 at 07:01:00PM -0700, Rajiv Prasad wrote:
> 
> Also, is (Open)SSH configured during RH7.1 installation, or do I have to
> do that later?

This at least I can answer. :-)

ssh is configured, in some default configuration, but sshd _server_ is
not installed by default in a "Workstation" installation.  You have to
pick it up explictely or install it later.

Also a version which comes on CD have known attacks against it and
these attacks are the latest fashion among script kiddies.  You have
to immediately update these before exposing to the outside world or
you may get cracked in no time.  Running on Alpha likely affords you
a bit of a protection here but do not trust it too much.

   Michal




