refuse and am now trying to get it working with my collection of spare
hardware. The machine came with Storageworks sleds, but not with
drives. Problem is that the sleds I have all take SCA drives and the
spare drives I've got are either 50-pin or 68-pin.

I believe that a storageworks sled with a 68-pin connector instead of
SCA does exist, but I'm not sure where I'd find them, or if there's an
easier way to plug my existing drives into this machine (Male 68-pin
to SCA adapters aren't exactly cheap, or common).

Besides looking on eBay for these things.. does anyone have any
suggestions? 

