I have a 200 4/166 on which I have been running linux since 1997. That's 
my baby! Works great.

First I used the combination ARC+Milo, but found that too uncool (and 
slow) and since I don't use NT I nowadays run SRM. If you are about to run 
RedHat there is good documentation on how to install the system.

I also have a PDF document covering the hardware aspects of the machine, 
which can be useful when upgrading stuff. I'll send it to you in private 
e-mail.

If you have problems with the installation and can't find help in the 
documentation, feel free to ask me and I'll se if I can help. No worries!

