I few years ago I purchased an Alpha machine that I never had the time =
to really work (play!) with.  I sold it.  A few days ago I decided, due =
to my new status of having a good deal of free time (unemployment), to =
get another DEC Alpha, this time a 433au.  I intend to install Linux of =
some flavor on it, so, a few questions:

Are there any clear favorites, in terms of distro's, for this machine?

Will this hardware support Linux unchanged?  I believe (the seller was =
not very helpful) that it is entirely as it left the factory.

Will I be better off with SRM as opposed to AlphaBIOS?

Does anyone have any hints as to problems I may incur?

Many thanks

Stephen
